WEBVTT

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.880
This is a mountain in the Swiss Alps.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.980
There's a rope that goes down a cliff.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.120
There's a pretty girl at the end of the rope.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.440
But there's an evil gas at the end of the rope.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.760
Mwahahahaha!

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.830
It's terrible, Mario!

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.960
Ah, it's a pleasure, pretty girl!

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:28.390
Your life is almost over.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.430
On the other hand, Mighty Mouse is...

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:43.410
Mighty Mouse: Here I go!

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.300
You can't do that! It's not like you're drinking water!

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.940
That was an intense blow! Mighty, you're in danger!

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.840
This is a famous Swiss cheese automation factory.

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:07.560
Mighty, who was on the belt conveyor,

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.760
got mixed up in the cheese

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:13.090
and turned into a cheese pattern.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:24.000
It's about time to drop it.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.440
Someone, listen to me.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.510
The veteran of the disaster rescue team came out bravely.

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:46.730
It's all right. Don't worry.

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:49.290
I'm here, so I'm sure I'll be fine.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:51.890
My father, my grandfather, my great-grandfather.

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:54.210
They all saved the disaster.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.310
My family is strong in every way.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.860
I'm good at listening and I'm very reliable.

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:02.610
You're in trouble too, aren't you?

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:05.010
I'll save you right now.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:14.050
You're good, Mighty!

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.830
That's Pretty-chan!

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.480
Now it's Kangas!

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:20.680
Huh? That's not it!

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:22.220
Can you run the cliff vertically?

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.040
The one who ran away is Deva-Box!

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:28.660
What do you think, Mighty?

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.000
I'll raise your head!

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:33.030
I will receive you, Pretty.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:36.030
Let go of me.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.030
Let go of me.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:41.880
If you are with me, you will be safe.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.990
It doesn't matter what you say.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.990
You just need to know how to hide it.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.930
There is nothing scary about it.

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:52.200
The evil gas that falls like an arrow.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:03:00.000
It throws Pretty out and turns into a counterattack.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.940
It's a gas locomotive that climbs up the hill according to the rules of the world.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:08.320
Oh, that's dangerous!

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:11.810
Maite, do your best! What are you doing?

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:17.540
I'm the winner!

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:23.910
Maite, Ma! Maite, Ma!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:28.610
He can't do it. I'm going to hit him.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.390
Let's go!

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:33.230
A duel, huh?

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.680
Alright, let's do it.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:41.170
Here we go.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:47.610
The one who was beaten is Akkangas.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.760
He goes straight to the hospital in the mountains.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:52.290
To the hospital.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.870
A visit from Mighty.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.740
Damn it, look at this.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:05.480
You're so strong.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.260
I was scared.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.470
That's all right.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:13.990
From now on, I'll never let you go again.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.400
Never?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:21.280
I'll never let you go again.
